        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LEONARD WILSON KEENAN ESTATE & LETTING AGENTS\r\nOur business is you...\r\n\r\nSPACIOUS 3 BED / 3 BATH SEMI-TERRACED ENERGY-EFFICIENT HOME\r\nLARGE ATTIC SUITABLE FOR CONVERSION | SOUTH-EASTERLY REAR GARDEN | TRIPLE GLAZED | B2 BER RATING\r\n\r\nA superbly presented family home in a prime location…\r\n\r\nThe multi award-winning team at Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present No. 3 Hoey Court, Clongriffin, Dublin 13. This spacious, energy-efficient home will appeal to first-time buyers, growing families, downsizers, and investors alike.\r\n\r\nSituated in one of Clongriffin’s most desirable and private developments, Hoey Court offers the perfect blend of tranquility and accessibility, with every convenience right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\nStylish and spacious 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom family home\r\n\r\nGenerous attic space, ideal for future conversion\r\n\r\nRecently upgraded with triple-glazed windows and stormproof tilt-opening system\r\n\r\nHigh-efficiency gas boiler and high-performance external doors\r\n\r\nExcellent BER rating of B2 – qualifies for green mortgage rates\r\n\r\nPrivate south-easterly facing rear garden with awning and bespoke patio doors\r\n\r\nOff-street parking for two cars with EV charging potential\r\n\r\nModern kitchen with integrated appliances and ample storage\r\n\r\nQuality flooring throughout and elegant tiling in all bathrooms\r\n\r\nMaster bedroom with en suite and built-in wardrobes in all rooms\r\n\r\nLayout Overview:\r\nGround floor: Welcoming hallway, guest WC, bright living room, and an open-plan kitchen/dining/family area leading to the garden.\r\nFirst floor: Landing, three spacious bedrooms (primary en suite), family bathroom, and attic access.\r\n\r\nLocation & Amenities:\r\nWithin walking distance of Clongriffin DART Station and several Dublin Bus routes\r\n\r\nMinutes from the M1/M50 and Dublin Airport\r\n\r\nClose to excellent schools including the newly built Belmayne Educate Together NS\r\n\r\nProximity to Clarehall & Donaghmede Shopping Centres\r\n\r\nNear the award-winning Father Collins Park (playing pitches, running track, playgrounds)\r\n\r\nIdeal for coastal and outdoor lifestyles with Howth, beaches, and green spaces nearby\r\n\r\nTrinity Sports & Leisure Centre with swimming pool and gym nearby\r\n\r\nThis home combines comfort, energy efficiency, and an enviable location—making it a standout opportunity in Dublin 13.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
